<title>USA: St Paul says in talks with Marsh on Minet unit.</title>
<headline>St Paul says in talks with Marsh on Minet unit.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>St Paul Cos Inc said Thursday it is in negotiations with Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc on the sale of the Minet Group insurance brokerage to Marsh &amp; McLennan.</p>
<p>The sale would exclude Swett &amp; Crawford Group and Minet Burn Roche.</p>
<p>St Paul said any sale is subject to due diligence, negotiation of a definitive agreement and other conditions.</p>
</text>
